lect only pieces that meet our standards of drape and durability."}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Our pieces are strictly ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"one-of-one"}],". Because human hands guide the shuttle, no two drapes are ever identical. When a saree leaves our boutique, that exact pattern in that exact dye run is never woven again."]}]]}],"$L16"]}]]}]}]
